+  - `src/csk/locking.py`
+  - `src/csk/transactions.py`
+  - `tests/test_locking.py`
+  - `tests/test_transactions.py`
+- The task worktree is clean and matches its remote branch.
+- Current task source hashes match the latest producer handoff:
